+
+## Optional private icon-cache tooling
+
+The local icon-cache builder invokes Arm astcenc 5.7.0 (Apache-2.0), from
+https://github.com/ARM-software/astc-encoder/releases/tag/5.7.0, and imports Pillow 13.0.0 (MIT-CMU) and FontTools
+4.68.0 (MIT). These tools live in ignored build folders and are not linked into the runtime. The official Windows
+x64 archive SHA256 used locally is cbde7c78adcc90d0d90ecf10f32d03f3340fbe1720cb6d6c892147d625e74d2d.
+Decoded Nintendo icons remain private game-derived data under build/; no license grant to those assets is implied.
+
+## Mod Menu installer
+
+The standalone Mod Menu installer embeds Arm astcenc 5.7.0's official Windows SSE2
+executable (Apache-2.0), together with its upstream LICENSE.txt. It also embeds the
+prepared Pillow 13.0.0 and FontTools 4.68.0 distributions used by the local icon-cache
+builder. Their distribution metadata and license directories accompany the files.
+The interpreter and compiler come from the player's original setup and are not
+redistributed by this installer. The embedded upstream recomp sources retain the
+MIT license and their existing third-party notices and source license headers.
